abstract: >-
  An executable, auditable fail-closed integrity contract for regional
  eQTL–GWAS integration, accompanied by synthetic verification, corrected
  multi-signal robustness experiments, an eleven-region LD-graph challenge,
  and an internally frozen multi-tissue workflow evaluation in coronary
  artery disease and heart failure. The release supports software-integrity
  and failure-handling claims; it does not assert biological or clinical findings.
